  "extraction_notes": "The figure presents a general scheme for the direct amidation of carboxylic acids with primary amines using boronic acid catalysts and molecular sieves (MS 4A). Two groups of catalysts (1-6) are shown with their corresponding temperature ranges for activity. The header reaction uses wildcard placeholders for the substrates and a generic boronic acid catalyst. Each catalyst variant (1-6) is recorded as a separate reaction using the specific boronic acid structure and the indicated temperature range."
